<div .container>
    ^{loginNotifyW}
    <div .row>
        <h2>Perform a substitution
    <div .row>
        <div .col-lg-12>
            <p>Here is a random formula!
            <p ##{displayFormulaId}.oblang>#{displayFormula formula}
    <div .row>
        <div .col-lg-12>
            <p>And here is a random substitution <code>s</code>! (For any atomic sentence <code>A</code> not listed, <code>s(A) = A</code>.)
            ^{substitutionWidget subst}
    <div .row>
      <div .col-lg-12>
        <p>What is the result of applying this substitution to this formula?
        <input ##{inputFormulaId} type=text>
        <div ##{buttonDivId}>
            <button .btn.btn-primary ##{submitButtonId}>Submit
    <div .row>
        <div .col-lg-12>
            <div ##{feedbackId}>
    <div .row>
        <div .col-lg-12>
            <p>You can input connectives by using the symbols below or their ASCII approximations as shown:
            <table .table.table-striped>
                <thead .thead-light>
                    <tr>
                        <th>Connective
                        <th>Write (click to copy symbol to your clipboard):
                <tbody>
                    <tr>
                        <td>Negation
                        <td>
                            <button .btn.btn-primary.conn-button ##{negButt}>
                                <code>¬
                                or
                                <code>~
                    <tr>
                        <td>Conjunction
                        <td>
                            <button .btn.btn-primary.conn-button ##{conjButt}>
                                <code>∧
                                or
                                <code>/\
                    <tr>
                        <td>Disjunction
                        <td>
                            <button .btn.btn-primary.conn-button ##{disjButt}>
                                <code>∨
                                or
                                <code>\/
                    <tr>
                        <td>Implication
                        <td>
                            <button .btn.btn-primary.conn-button ##{implButt}>
                                <code>→
                                or
                                <code>->
                    <tr>
                        <td>Falsum
                        <td>
                            <button .btn.btn-primary.conn-button ##{fumButt}>
                                <code>⊥
                                or
                                <code>_|_
                    <tr>
                        <td>Verum
                        <td>
                            <button .btn.btn-primary.conn-button ##{vumButt}>
                                <code>⊤
                                or
                                <code>T
